SHA-256 95f59c307870207e4f518a95dfc4786d935c5ef62599047d5997ae4aac23d708):
- bindings/matrix-sdk-ffi/src/room/mod.rs: adds a cached, read-only
  Room.accountDataRaw(eventType:) accessor.
- crates/matrix-sdk-ui/src/room_list_service/mod.rs: adds two exact,
  empty-key required-state types (io.atum.conversation, io.atum.app_bot.dm).
